[h1]Languages[/h1][url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/server-manager/README/README.html]EN/English[/url] | [url=https://lyuwenhan.github.io/extensions/minecraft-java/data/assets/server-manager/README/README_ZH-CN.html]ZH-CN/简体中文[/url]
[h1]Server Manager[/h1]A Fabric server-side mod that provides a web-based Minecraft server management panel.
It allows you to monitor server status, manage online players, view logs, execute commands, edit game rules, and manage Carpet rules when Carpet is installed.
[h2]Features[/h2][list]
[*]Web-based server management panel[/*]
[*]Login authentication[/*]
[*]Dashboard for server statistics[/*]
[*]Online player list[/*]
[*]Player operations[/*]
[*]Server log viewer[/*]
[*]Command execution panel[/*]
[*]Gamerule management[/*]
[*]Carpet rule management when installed[/*]
[/list][h2]Page Overview[/h2][list]
[*]Dashboard[/*]
[*]Players[/*]
[*]Logs[/*]
[*]Command[/*]
[*]Gamerule[/*]
[*]Carpet Rule[/*]
[/list][h2]Command Page[/h2]The Command page allows server commands to be executed from the web panel.
If the input starts with [b]/[/b], it is sent as a command.
If the input does not start with [b]/[/b], it is sent as a [b]say[/b] command.
[h2]Player Management[/h2]The Players page shows online players and provides common operations.
Displayed player information includes:
[list]
[*]Name[/*]
[*]Status[/*]
[*]Dimension[/*]
[*]Position[/*]
[*]Health[/*]
[*]Hunger[/*]
[*]Level[/*]
[*]Gamemode[/*]
[*]Ping[/*]
[/list]Supported player operations include:
[list]
[*]Heal[/*]
[*]Feed[/*]
[*]Clear inventory[/*]
[*]Kill[/*]
[*]Kick[/*]
[*]Ban[/*]
[*]Add to whitelist[/*]
[*]OP[/*]
[/list][h2]Access Control[/h2]The Players page also includes access control tables.
Supported lists:
[list]
[*]Whitelist[/*]
[*]Blacklist[/*]
[*]Operators[/*]
[/list]Supported operations include:
[list]
[*]Enable or disable whitelist[/*]
[*]Remove whitelist entries[/*]
[*]Remove blacklist entries[/*]
[*]Remove operator permissions[/*]
[/list][h2]Gamerule Management[/h2]The Gamerule page lists server gamerules by category.
For each gamerule, the page can show:
[list]
[*]Name[/*]
[*]Type[/*]
[*]Current value[/*]
[*]Default value[/*]
[*]Allowed values[/*]
[*]Recommended values[/*]
[/list][h2]Carpet Rule Management[/h2]The Carpet Rule page follows the same rule UI format as the Gamerule page.
If Carpet is installed, rules can be viewed and changed from the web panel.
[h2]Supported Versions[/h2][list]
[*]Minecraft 26.1.2[/*]
[*]Fabric Loader 0.19.2+[/*]
[*]Fabric API 0.150.0+[/*]
[*]Java 25[/*]
[*]Carpet (Optional)[/*]
[/list][h2]License[/h2]MIT
